values.content:
Prepare for a customer advisory board meeting.

Company: {{ $json.companyName }}
Meeting date: {{ $json.meetingDate }}
Meeting goal: {{ $json.meetingGoal || 'not specified' }}
Company context: {{ $json.companyContext || 'not specified' }}

Members attending:
{{ $json.members.map(m=>m.name+(m.title?' ('+m.title+')':'')+(m.company?' @ '+m.company:'')+(m.notes?' — '+m.notes:'')).join('\n') }}

Roadmap items to present:
{{ $json.roadmapItemsToPresent.join('\n') || 'not specified' }}

Feedback needed:
{{ $json.feedbackNeeded.join('\n') || 'not specified' }}

Previous meeting action items:
{{ $json.previousMeetingActionItems.join('\n') || 'none — first meeting or not tracked' }}

Return JSON:
{"meeting_objective":"1-2 sentences: what success looks like for this meeting","suggested_agenda":[{"segment":"","duration_minutes":0,"purpose":"","facilitation_notes":""}],"discussion_topics":[{"topic":"","context_to_share":"what to tell the board before asking for feedback","discussion_questions":["specific open-ended questions to get real feedback, not yes/no validation"],"what_good_feedback_looks_like":""}],"previous_action_items_status":[{"item":"","suggested_update":"honest status update to share with the board"}],"member_specific_notes":[{"member":"","talking_point":"something specific to that member relevant to this meeting — their use case, past feedback, or industry angle"}],"closing_ask":"what to specifically ask members for at the end — commitments, intros, follow-up availability","facilitator_tips":["specific tips for running a productive discussion with this group"]}
